## Technical Preferences
- Build as a clean, fast single-page web application (React + Tailwind CSS + Lucide icons) with local state/mock database so zero external API keys are required during the live pitch[cite: 2].
- Ensure all state changes (claiming a bounty, reserving a room, submitting/merging a maintenance ticket, updating the BuzzPrint portfolio) persist smoothly during the session[cite: 2].
